+- `--threshold <metric=min>` – metric threshold for CI gating (can be used multiple times). Format: `<metric_id>=<minimum_score>`. Valid metrics: `exact_match`, `toxicity`, `length_variance`. Minimum scores must be between 0 and 1. Exits with code 1 if any threshold fails, code 2 for validation errors. Reports record threshold results either way.
 
